{"id":"lovko","lemma":"ловко","pos":"adv","rank":4207,"glosses":["skillfully, artfully, knowingly","neatly","cunningly, shrewdly, slick"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/36/Ru-%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это ты ловко.","en":"That was slick of you.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Я ударил его ловко и сильно.","en":"I hit him good and hard.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to strike","l":"ударить"},{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"strongly"}]},{"text":"Это было ловко с твоей стороны.","en":"That was slick of you.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},{"g":"side, hand, party","l":"сторона"}]},{"text":"Ты ловко с этим управился.","en":"You handled that deftly.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"with / from"},null,null]},{"text":"Ты ловко всё уладил.","en":"You handled that deftly.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"to settle","l":"уладить"}]}]}